## How to query this business

- This file: {{ page.agents_md_url }}
- HTML page: {{ page.html_url }}
- Markdown: {{ page.md_url }}
- JSON feed: {{ page.feed_url }}
- JSON-LD: embedded in the HTML page as `application/ld+json`
- UCP profile: {{ page.ucp_url }}
- MCP endpoint (Streamable HTTP): {{ base }}/mcp

MCP tools:

- `search_businesses` — filter published businesses by attributes. Example: `{"q": "{{ page.name }}"}`
- `get_business` — full typed catalog. Example: `{"slug": "{{ page.slug }}"}`
- `get_offering` — one offering and its conversion points. Example: `{"business_slug": "{{ page.slug }}", "offering_slug": "{% if page.offerings %}{{ page.offerings[0].slug }}{% else %}<offering-slug>{% endif %}"}`
- `list_conversion_points` — input JSON Schema for each conversion point. Example: `{"business_slug": "{{ page.slug }}"}`
- `submit_conversion` — submit after validating the payload. Example: `{"conversion_point_id": "<id from list_conversion_points>", "payload": {}}`

